<template><div class="public-page"><section class="page-hero section-wrap"><p class="kicker">Our method</p><h1>Less volume.<br>More accountability.</h1><p>BK Football Predictions is built around selectivity, readable reasoning and a visible record.</p></section><section class="section-wrap principles-grid"><article><span>01</span><h2>Selection before publication</h2><p>Not every fixture belongs on the board. The owner publishes only the matches that meet the day’s standard.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h2>Context beside confidence</h2><p>Confidence figures are accompanied by a market, kickoff time and short reasoning. They never represent certainty.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h2>Access enforced at source</h2><p>Member analysis is protected by the API and tied to active package access.</p></article></section><section class="responsibility section-wrap"><p class="kicker">Responsible use</p><h2>Predictions support judgement. They do not replace it.</h2><p>Football outcomes remain uncertain. Set limits, avoid chasing losses and do not treat any selection as guaranteed income. This service is intended for adults aged 18 and over.</p></section></div></template>
